title: 'fatxpool: fix dropped watcher leaking entries and repeating Viewless events'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The dropped watcher did not forget transactions that were removed from the pool as usurped,
    dropped by limits, or invalid (also when reported via `report_invalid`). Since #11731 it kept
    sending a `Viewless` event for each of them on every view removal, until the node was restarted.

    These transactions are now removed from the dropped watcher when they are removed from the pool.
    Also, a `Viewless` event for a transaction that is not in the mempool now removes it from the
    dropped watcher and is logged at debug level.
crates:
- name: sc-transaction-pool
  bump: patch
